# The working corpus: ~1000 PR directories holding raw diffs, several hundred MB, plus the
# per-stage intermediates. Derived data — rebuilt deterministically by `study clone` and
# `study collect` (seeded sampling), so versioning it would bloat the repo to reproduce
# something a command already reproduces.
#
# Publishable artifacts do NOT live here. `study publish` copies them into results/, which is
# committed. See results/README.md.
data/

# Local clones of the studied repositories, when placed inside the study directory.
clones/

node_modules/
